{"calculus_ref":"stdo://releases/v2.5.0-rc.6/standards/AXIOMATIC_CALCULUS.md","clause_relations":[{"arguments":[{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:closed-frame-result","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:reference-frame","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:residual-judgment","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"literal":"Reuse an unchanged closed result only after checking exact applicability. A material input change or declared revising observation invalidates the affected result before reliance, preserving predecessor/successor and demonstrably independent survivors. Required independent evaluations may share valid mechanical evidence but still acquire sufficient exact evidence and supply their own judgment under the actual independence conditions.","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:requirement"}],"clause_type":"constraint","operator":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:operator:requires","uri":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:closed-result-reuse-preserves-required-independence"},{"arguments":[{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:work-outcome","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:residual-judgment","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:owner-ruling","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"literal":"Reuse valid evidence and J/O for unchanged obligations. A material counterexample or changed evidence/basis invalidates the affected claim and dependent results before reliance. Retain unrelated observations as bounded repricing input without automatic reopening or work expansion. Closure recording preserves exact evaluated scope, satisfied conditions, evidence and surviving residual obligations.","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:requirement"}],"clause_type":"constraint","operator":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:operator:preserves","uri":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:closure-reuse-retains-independent-progress"},{"arguments":[{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:executive","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:worker","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"literal":"For the coordinated branch, Executive locks outcome/basis, selects the smallest dependency-ready frontier, consumes closed results and assigns priority, boundary effect, disposition and next action only within its existing authority. Reviewer returns technical evidence/triage without repair or decision authority. Direct Writer work instead returns to its declared work authority or existing result carrier under the same result algebra and operation/decision separation; Executive handoff is not a universal prerequisite.","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:requirement"}],"clause_type":"constraint","operator":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:operator:requires","uri":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:engagement-return-topology"},{"arguments":[{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:executive","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:worker","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"literal":"Executive performs no candidate, Product, worktree or implementation mutation. Before effects, the actor explicitly records a separate Worker/Writer activation with exact grant, subject and write territory. Tool access, small/reversible/test-only edits, later recording or later delegation cannot supply or retroactively authorize that transition; changing role supplies no independent assessment.","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:requirement"}],"clause_type":"constraint","operator":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:operator:forbids","uri":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:executive-mutation-needs-prior-writer-transition"},{"arguments":[{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:executive","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"literal":"When Executive coordination is selected for delivery, establish early or extend the smallest real runnable supported-entry-to-outcome thread through the selected composition. Choose bounded increments by consequential uncertainty, dependency/interface reach and failure impact. Early end-to-end and integration evidence prunes incompatible construction choices, settles only exercised interfaces and preserves working composition. A passing thread supports only exercised relations and conditions; material untested branches, combinations, refusals and recovery retain their proof obligations. Revisit settled construction decisions when material counterevidence invalidates their basis. During construction use focused deterministic regression and targeted judgment probes. Keep module-derived unit evidence for module-owned laws and its smallest congruent population. Schedule substantial resource-intensive UAT near release or when a bounded capability is complete enough to qualify; use an early focused user probe when it decides material outcome uncertainty. The testing frames retain distinct user-outcome, authoritative runnable-path, composition and module-law claims and govern necessary scenarios, independence and repetitions. Reuse qualified exact-subject/basis results while valid and rerun affected assurance after material invalidation. Existing mandates and operation grants govern all activation and effects.","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:requirement"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:engagement-return-topology","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:condition"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:executive-mutation-needs-prior-writer-transition","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:support"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:closed-result-reuse-preserves-required-independence","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:support"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:closure-reuse-retains-independent-progress","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:support"},{"literal":"This delivery sequence does not appoint Executive for sufficient direct Writer work, waive a module-derived unit lane, infer task applicability, supply a universal repeat count or cost gate, or expand the existing operation grant.","role":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:role:qualification"}],"clause_type":"constraint","operator":"urn:stdo-representation:vocabulary:operator:requires","uri":"urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:executive-steel-thread-delivery"}],"closure":{"clauses":["urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:closed-result-reuse-preserves-required-independence","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:closure-reuse-retains-independent-progress","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:engagement-return-topology","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:executive-mutation-needs-prior-writer-transition","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:executive-steel-thread-delivery"],"residuals":["urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:complete-update-selection-and-evidence-remain-owned","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:compression-overlap-needs-source-reentry","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:frame-adoption-not-claimed","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:full-m-b-not-constructed","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:outcome-effects-and-retry-need-exact-task-evidence","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:prompt-projection-does-not-select-solution","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:rule-conflict-and-intended-meaning-require-owned-resolution","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:semantic-acceptance-not-supplied","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:successor-construction-and-qualification-not-yet-joined","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:task-frame-obligations-require-owned-applicability"],"symbols":["urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:a-c","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:authority-compression","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:closed-frame-result","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:complete-consumer-update-plan","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:declared-treatment-rule","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:executive","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:frame-applicability","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:governed-treatment","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:observed-effect-state","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:owner-ruling","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:reference-frame","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:release-matched-cohort","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:residual-judgment","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:source-corpus","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:work-outcome","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:worker","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:symbol:working-authoring-surface"]},"frame_indexes":[{"clause_refs":["urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:clause:executive-steel-thread-delivery"],"frame_ref":"stdo://releases/v2.5.0-rc.6/standards/STDO_REFERENCE_FRAME_BASELINE.md#derived-executive-frame","residual_refs":["urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:frame-adoption-not-claimed","urn:stdo-representation:a-c-text:residual:task-frame-obligations-require-owned-applicability"],"scope":"Sequence an explicitly selected coordinated Product-delivery outcome under its existing Executive mandate, using an early real steel thread and claim-bound assurance. This index does not select Executive for direct Writer work, provide task facts or acceptance, or grant construction effects.","source_refs":["stdo://releases/v2.5.0-rc.6/standards/STDO_REF